  "details": "VRChat Version: 2021.1.5p2\nDescription of the bug: The ToonCutout fallback shader casts and receives shadows on parts of the material that have been cut-out.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Add \"ToonCutout\" to the name of a shader, give it a _Color property and a _Cutoff property with a greater value than the alpha value of the _Color propery and put it on your avatar (see extra files for a shader that does all this). Join a world that has a dynamic directional light with shadows enabled and have another user disable your shaders in the safety settings so that the fallback shader is used.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): Shader that falls back to ToonCutout: https://gist.github.com/Mysteryem/c7e57bc948b2f1682c328f26916833fa",
